WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.570 --> 00:00:04.310
Hey guys, it’s Dave, if you’re here on
my Patreon page, it means that you’re considering

00:00:04.310 --> 00:00:07.280
supporting me in my quest to educate the world.

00:00:07.280 --> 00:00:11.100
I want to raise the bar of science literacy
in our society, and I sure could use your help.

00:00:11.120 --> 00:00:14.240
Unlike some of the bigger educational channels,
I don’t have a staff, I don’t have any

00:00:14.240 --> 00:00:17.470
grants or funding, this is a low-budget one-man show.

00:00:17.470 --> 00:00:22.679
I write, edit, and animate all the content
on my channel, while managing all other aspects

00:00:22.679 --> 00:00:23.679
of being an entrepreneur.

00:00:23.679 --> 00:00:27.960
It’s a lot of work, and I’m usually at
it about sixty or seventy hours a week, so

00:00:27.960 --> 00:00:30.689
calling it my passion is an understatement.

00:00:30.689 --> 00:00:35.149
The problem is that the ad revenue I earn
from my YouTube channel is nowhere near commensurate

00:00:35.149 --> 00:00:36.620
with the work I put in.

00:00:36.620 --> 00:00:40.379
Even with tens of thousands of views per day,
it’s just not a living wage.

00:00:40.379 --> 00:00:44.559
Beyond that, I have to pay people to check
my scripts for errors, operate camera and

00:00:44.559 --> 00:00:48.359
audio when I shoot the content, and all kinds
of other things, so I sure could use some

00:00:48.359 --> 00:00:50.180
help covering those costs.

00:00:50.180 --> 00:00:54.609
If I can get enough support from you guys,
the viewers who benefit from all this hard

00:00:54.609 --> 00:00:58.570
work, I can even hire people to help with
some of the writing and animating, which means

00:00:58.570 --> 00:01:03.219
I could move much faster, and put out twice
as much content every week.

00:01:03.219 --> 00:01:06.700
Even though I’ve already covered a lot of
topics, from chemistry to biology to physics

00:01:06.700 --> 00:01:11.140
and tons more, there are still so many other
subjects left to do, and I’m not going to

00:01:11.140 --> 00:01:12.890
stop until I do them all.

00:01:12.890 --> 00:01:15.420
So please check out the rewards on this page.

00:01:15.420 --> 00:01:20.229
For just a few dollars a month you can get
access to exclusive material, live chatting

00:01:20.229 --> 00:01:25.100
with me, you can vote on what subjects I cover
next, or even get one-on-one tutoring.

00:01:25.100 --> 00:01:29.079
These are just some of the ways I want to
thank you guys for taking the initiative to

00:01:29.079 --> 00:01:33.350
help when you didn’t even have to, because
that’s how we are going to create the world

00:01:33.350 --> 00:01:34.670
we all want to live in.

00:01:34.670 --> 00:01:35.659
I’ll see you on YouTube.

